  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health: UK support for regional preparedness to prevent the spread of Ebola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To resource multilateral agencies and international partners to put in place appropriate, effective, rapid, prioritised and targeted interventions to support pan-African preparedness in the highest risk countries, in the majority of which there is no DFID presence.</narrative>
  </description>
